<title>ITALY: Italy bank bad loans up 13.8 pct y/y in Oct - BoI.</title>
<headline>Italy bank bad loans up 13.8 pct y/y in Oct - BoI.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bad loans held by Italian banks totalled 120.132 trillion lire in October, up 13.8 percent year-on-year, the Bank of Italy said in its latest report.</p>
<p>In September, bad loans in the banking system totalled 119.097 trillion lire.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
